:''For the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] counterpart, see [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Dark Mitama''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]] and can be obtained when rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] events. The main difference with her [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|UBERFEST counterpart]] is that she gains [[Resistant|resistance]] and is a crowd controller against [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] but was unobtainable. She was then officially added in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|December 15, 2023 Update Patch]].

