==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Gothic Mitama''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Dark Mitama is easily one of the best anti-[[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] crowd-controllers in the game. She has increased health and damage, higher standing range and Weaken compared to her original form. This allows her to render even the most powerful Traitless enemies such as [[R.Ost]] practically useless, making most of the Crazed and Manic Stages a cakewalk. Her immunities to Waves, Knockback, Freeze, Slow and Weaken make many enemies such as [[Henry]] and [[Dober P.D]] go from rather troublesome enemies to practically peons. Her decent 5.4k DPS is nothing to scoff at, either, and combined with her crowd-controlling capabilites, it's no surprise that Dark Mitama is amazing against [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies.

However, Gothic Mitama is not without weaknesses, as her general use is rather lackluster. Her stats are nothing special against traited enemies, which the majority of the time will be the main threat. Her lack of Curse and Surge immunities also make her a dangerous pick against [[Kappy Jr.]] and [[Master Uril (Enemy)|Master Uril]]. However, this is not to say that Gothic Mitama is a bad unit, just that she might not be the best choice in every stage in the game.

